{"unit_id":"divineeagleblackhand__dsh-cost-receipt#feature-1","repo":"divineeagleblackhand/dsh-cost-receipt","commit":"ad7cc6492e51c8f1a0f5b6f5e40870602dc82c70","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-cost-receipt** 的功能「费用估算」：按轮次 token 用量和所用模型的单价计算费用，并区分缓存命中、未命中、缓存写入和输出；依据轮次结束时间判定峰谷时段。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:217-251"]}
