{"unit_id":"divineeagleblackhand__dsh-cost-receipt#feature-4","repo":"divineeagleblackhand/dsh-cost-receipt","commit":"ad7cc6492e51c8f1a0f5b6f5e40870602dc82c70","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-cost-receipt** 的功能「无法计价提示」：遇到未收录模型、混合模型或缺少模型信息时显示原因，不用其他模型价格代算。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:142-149"]}
{"unit_id":"divineeagleblackhand__dsh-cost-receipt#caveat-1","repo":"divineeagleblackhand/dsh-cost-receipt","commit":"ad7cc6492e51c8f1a0f5b6f5e40870602dc82c70","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost-receipt 使用会话可见的 token 用量估算费用；服务端 web_search 用量及搜索/抓取按次费用不在估算内，因此相关金额可能偏低。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:880-890"]}
